At noon, Prakash and I are sitting in the canteen to eat food.
Then Deepa comes to our table.
Deepa is the designer in our team.
I only know her by face.
She comes and sits next to me.
"Maya, I am Deepa," she smiles at me.
She shows some pictures on a tablet.
"I have done a few designs for the new project," Deepa says.
Those designs are very beautiful.
"How many years have you been working as a designer?" I ask.
"I have worked as a designer for five years," Deepa replies.
Then we start eating food.
Deepa has brought rice and fish curry today.
Deepa asks me about my hometown.
I talk to her about Mexico.
Afterwards, I ask Deepa about her hometown.
"My hometown is Kannur," she says.
Prakash talks to us about the good food in Kannur.
Today's lunch with the team is very enjoyable.
